<w:r>
<w:rPr>
<w:b/>
<w:bCs/>
</w:rPr>
<w:t xml:space="preserve">Term and Termination</w:t>
</w:r>
<w:r>
<w:t xml:space="preserve">. This MNDA commences on the </w:t>
</w:r>
<w:r>
<w:t xml:space="preserve">Effective Date</w:t>
</w:r>
<w:r>
<w:t xml:space="preserve"> and expires at the end of the </w:t>
</w:r>
<w:r>
<w:t xml:space="preserve">MNDA Term</w:t>
</w:r>
<w:r>
<w:t xml:space="preserve">. Either party may terminate this MNDA for any or no reason upon written notice to the other party. The Receiving Party’s obligations relating to Confidential Information will survive for the </w:t>
</w:r>
<w:r>
<w:t xml:space="preserve">Term of Confidentiality</w:t>
</w:r>
<w:r>
<w:t xml:space="preserve">, despite any expiration or termination of this MNDA.</w:t>
