</w:r>
<w:r>
<w:t xml:space="preserve">Governing Law</w:t>
</w:r>
<w:r>
<w:t xml:space="preserve">. Any legal suit, action, or proceeding relating to this MNDA must be instituted in the federal or state courts located in </w:t>
